Reproducer of the deadlock fixed by webkit/0002-Skia-Don-t-deadlock-*.patch
(SkiaGLContext::releaseUnusedResources() held m_lock over freeGpuResources()).

  cc -O1 -g -o stress stress.c \
     $(pkg-config --cflags --libs wpe-webkit-2.0 wpe-platform-2.0 wpe-platform-headless-2.0)
  ./run.sh LIBDIR below 30

It is headless (no X or Wayland display; a render node is needed) and uses a
private HOME and runtime directory.  Constant critical memory pressure meets
tiles with promise images that change just below the visible area.

  stock WPE WebKit 2.54.3:            HUNG within a second (exit code 3)
  with the patch:                     OK (exit code 0)
  stock, WEBKIT_SKIA_ENABLE_DDL=0:    OK (no promise images)

WPEWebProcess is started from the library's compiled-in prefix, so test a
library that is not installed yet over that prefix in a private mount
namespace (bwrap --ro-overlay), not only with LD_LIBRARY_PATH.
